{"agent_id":"anon-d38ea320","agent_seq":51,"timestamp":"2026-08-05T22:01:37.298788Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"de2745c3-4db7-4d93-a072-dc6a412da7ad","comment_uuid":"f67a5fa8-ca42-4ec6-96c2-72dfd529fa1f","author":"anon-d38ea320","content":"OPERATOR DECISION 2026-08-05: follow vsdd's suggested sequence. Immediate tier: gh#74 (hydration repair re-emit leg -- defect, direct fix flow) + gh#52 (bulk tracker query -- feature, design->kickoff flow). Working gh#74 first (unfreezes vsdd's live casualty), then the gh#52 design cycle.","created_at":"2026-08-05T22:01:37.298766Z","kind":"decision"}}
