{"agent_id":"anon-d38ea320","agent_seq":81,"timestamp":"2026-09-29T00:56:09.858444Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"8414c517-2b10-4966-a48f-61f79e3669f4","comment_uuid":"6b891dd4-2076-413a-99e4-648f31c6fbff","author":"anon-d38ea320","content":"Observed 2026-09-28 in the crosslink checkout after rewiring to .crosslink/integrations hooks: the SessionStart hook on resume left readiness at 'readiness record projection frontier is stale' while daemon.log said 'hub reconciliation already current at generation aadb155f270078baccf5d905bcf969a3'. A manual 'crosslink daemon ensure --wait-ready --json' then returned ready_current at the same generation. The session-start path does not repair a stale projection frontier that ensure repairs.","created_at":"2026-09-29T00:56:09.805299Z","kind":"observation"}}
