{"agent_id":"anon-d38ea320","agent_seq":87,"timestamp":"2026-09-29T02:06:46.744195Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"98fe06cc-c504-468b-b59c-47700cf9c077","comment_uuid":"02f0622d-d956-4f0c-9bda-47147afed2dc","author":"anon-d38ea320","content":"Reproduced on a clean detached worktree at 973e395dc (no local changes), each group run alone on an idle machine: daemon_readiness 4/7 fail (fresh_hook_initialized_local_repository_bootstraps_to_ready, daemon_survives_launcher_process_group_cleanup, daemon_recovers_hot_rollback_journal_before_reconciliation, concurrent_ensure_converges_and_offline_exit_is_structured — each crosslink child killed at the 15 s cap with empty stdout/stderr); provider_hooks 2-3/21 (heartbeat_runs_once_for_one_logical_provider_event, work_check_readiness_diagnostics_match_cli_access_for_both_providers, intermittently work_check_allows_only_the_explicit_init_recovery_in_a_blocked_repository — the fake crosslink call log is never written, ENOENT); lib reconcile::migration::tests::production_ready_observer_completes_fallback_pointer_window ('fallback pointer hook was not reached'). Not caused by #65.","created_at":"2026-09-29T02:06:46.693932Z","kind":"observation"}}
