{"agent_id":"anon-d38ea320","agent_seq":97,"timestamp":"2026-10-01T21:44:13.441871Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"b1c3567b-88ec-4ed5-9c53-62468c3f9e5f","comment_uuid":"da8f54fc-11fa-4431-a771-24ed6389bc23","author":"anon-d38ea320","content":"Test issue created by two kickoff runs on 2026-10-01. Run 1: the worktree reached readiness in under 2 minutes, then the container launch failed pulling the private default image (Corvidae-Coding-Projects/crosslink#101). Run 2 (--image fork nightly) failed because run 1's agent Lvh2 still held this issue's lock. Kickoff does not release the lock or remove the worktree when a launch fails, and 'kickoff cleanup --force' removed the worktrees but left the lock and the feature branches.","created_at":"2026-10-01T21:44:13.414387Z","kind":"result"}}
