{"agent_id":"anon-d38ea320","agent_seq":117,"timestamp":"2026-10-01T23:31:54.147480Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"1ad8dcf4-51a7-406b-8c3d-65b875a6732b","comment_uuid":"d6db7e54-743e-48e9-986d-1e84e60697df","author":"anon-d38ea320","content":"Committed. mdatron 069492aa and vsdd-cli 95840451 on branch chore/stock-crosslink-wiring in each repo (temporary worktrees removed; live checkouts untouched). Fork: b-commit on fix/scope-wait-ready-to-kickoff removes ensure_and_wait and the 1800 s bound; daemon.rs is identical to upstream develop; fmt and clippy clean; kickoff unit tests 203 passed. Not done: the lock-confirmation bound stays at 120 s until the write cost (#67) is fixed; vsdd-cli tracker issue not filed because that repo's daemon is down and readiness is hands-off.","created_at":"2026-10-01T23:31:54.117156Z","kind":"result"}}
{"agent_id":"anon-d38ea320","agent_seq":118,"timestamp":"2026-10-01T23:32:18.147757Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"1ad8dcf4-51a7-406b-8c3d-65b875a6732b","comment_uuid":"9ecb43d7-7ad4-4314-b9a6-a752c4021b6c","author":"anon-d38ea320","content":"The fork commit referred to above is 27726da8c on fix/scope-wait-ready-to-kickoff.","created_at":"2026-10-01T23:32:18.118649Z","kind":"observation"}}
{"agent_id":"anon-d38ea320","agent_seq":119,"timestamp":"2026-10-02T18:46:18.149482Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"7c480920-649e-44fa-bf38-2a1788982af6","comment_uuid":"f8c9b595-7273-4cd8-b511-12286936f1fe","author":"anon-d38ea320","content":"Plan for the fix (branch fix/daemon-recovers-expired-record, filed upstream as Corvidae-Coding-Projects/crosslink#106): when a housekeeping tick finds the daemon's own record older than MAX_RECORD_AGE_SECONDS, the normal loop returns to run_daemon, which runs reconcile_until_ready again with the same identity instead of exiting. Only the expired-record case takes that path; every other housekeeping failure stays an error. 'daemon ensure --wait-ready' keeps waiting while a live daemon's record is expired instead of failing with 'readiness record is stale'. Unit tests cover the expired path, the unchanged error path, and the ensure wait; an end-to-end run on a scratch repository repeats both reproductions.","created_at":"2026-10-02T18:46:18.120572Z","kind":"plan"}}
{"agent_id":"anon-d38ea320","agent_seq":120,"timestamp":"2026-10-02T19:00:39.110494Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"7c480920-649e-44fa-bf38-2a1788982af6","comment_uuid":"6bcc9655-f86e-4206-aa87-8dc7ebf80638","author":"anon-d38ea320","content":"Fix committed on fix/daemon-recovers-expired-record. Unit tests: 3 new, plus the neighbouring daemon and readiness tests (27 passed). End to end on a scratch repository with the built binary: suspend 100 s -> same daemon ready again 20 s after resume; write killed 100 s after publishing -> same daemon ready again 38 s after the kill; daemon.log shows 'readiness record expired; reconciling again.' in both. Note from the first end-to-end attempt: a killed writer that its parent has not reaped (a zombie) still counts as a live permit owner, so the daemon defers until it is reaped; that is existing behaviour and not changed here. Not tested: recovery when the network is down at the moment of re-reconciliation.","created_at":"2026-10-02T19:00:39.058962Z","kind":"result"}}
{"agent_id":"anon-d38ea320","agent_seq":121,"timestamp":"2026-10-02T21:44:30.521634Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"7c480920-649e-44fa-bf38-2a1788982af6","comment_uuid":"72184919-e2aa-40fd-9b86-6b6b247eeae1","author":"anon-d38ea320","content":"Reviewer findings on the two upstream branches handled so far. pr/sequence-seed: rewritten per review. The seed now reads the ref's full history (RefHubSource::read_agent_history, the verifier's own basis) instead of a lineage-gated checkpoint frontier; SharedWriter::new propagates a seed error instead of unwrap_or(0); the dead checkpoint/state.json path and git_is_ancestor are gone; tests: direct compact-then-write (fails on unfixed upstream), SharedWriter-level compact-then-create (passes with the fix; not run without it), pruned tip keeps the seed. Verified: 199 bin + 39 lib hub/writer/compaction tests pass. pr/verified-fixes: fixes pending for the reviewer's findings (terminal non-ready state after ensure in kickoff; worktree daemon never stopped; expired-record guard must check the record belongs to this daemon; hub-cache gitdir spelling vs mounted .git; --image help text and leading-dash values; record_expired visibility).","created_at":"2026-10-02T21:44:30.485264Z","kind":"observation"}}
