{"agent_id":"anon-d38ea320","agent_seq":141,"timestamp":"2026-10-05T20:06:33.883451Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"44e903a1-8817-44d1-b9d5-f8e4b5d601b7","comment_uuid":"5dfaab5f-0006-44e7-b5e0-b344d5c35b9d","author":"anon-d38ea320","content":"Kickoff test on the stock binary 875066ad6 with the fork nightly image, 2026-10-05. Launch succeeded in 106 s: issue, worktree, readiness, lock claim (no confirmation timeout), container start. The agent started, took the lock, read #67, and its first hub write failed: 'v3 own-ref publication for agent pg7D failed: fatal: could not read Username for https://github.com' (upstream #109). The agent could not publish anything after that, so the run was stopped and cleaned up. Result: container kickoff launches and runs on the stock binary; it cannot deliver results to the hub until #109 is decided.","created_at":"2026-10-05T20:06:33.847368Z","kind":"result"}}
{"agent_id":"anon-d38ea320","agent_seq":142,"timestamp":"2026-10-05T20:06:51.673466Z","event":{"type":"StatusChanged","uuid":"44e903a1-8817-44d1-b9d5-f8e4b5d601b7","new_status":"closed","closed_at":"2026-10-05T20:06:51.644153Z"}}
{"agent_id":"anon-d38ea320","agent_seq":143,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T19:00:22.876604Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"2847b97f-5f2e-4837-93bb-4d4a1e357804","title":"Transient transport error during post-wake reconciliation leaves the daemon blocked_corrupt (upstream #111)","description":"Observed 2026-10-05 23:40-23:45 UTC on 875066ad6: record expired during sleep, daemon re-reconciled on wake (the #69 fix working), git ls-remote origin failed with 'Recv failure: Connection reset by peer', activation classified it Rejected -> blocked_corrupt, terminal and sticky for 19 h until daemon stop + ensure. Cause: is_remote_unavailable_message in reconcile/publication.rs does not recognise connection-reset / recv-failure / SSL / generic 'unable to access' as transport failures. Fix: classify transport failures as Unavailable (waiting_for_remote with retry), and do not let a remote failure during re-reconciliation be terminal. Filed upstream as Corvidae-Coding-Projects/crosslink#111.","priority":"high","created_by":"anon-d38ea320"}}
