{"agent_id":"anon-d38ea320","agent_seq":149,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T19:14:01.072059Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"769a581f-a3f5-4bf9-b95a-67ea16f9b75d","comment_uuid":"b132379b-ecc1-402f-9085-d2b171b7ae49","author":"anon-d38ea320","content":"Plan: AuthProvider enum in commands/container.rs (claude, codex, github) with volume name, mount path and login/status commands; credential_volume keeps its AgentProvider signature; github_login_args mounts crosslink-auth-github-<uid> at /home/agent/.config/gh when the volume exists and sets CROSSLINK_REQUIRE_GIT_LOGIN=1 when the hub has a remote, or fails the launch with the login command when the volume is missing and the hub has a remote; kickoff launch_container and container start both use it. Entrypoint: prepares /home/agent/.config/gh, refuses to start when required and gh auth status fails, runs gh auth setup-git after writing .gitconfig. Dockerfile installs gh from GitHub's apt repository. CI smoke checks gh --version. --provider accepts github on all four commands. Guide updated. Tests: provider parsing/volume/mount/commands, entrypoint and Dockerfile markers, no-remote case of github_login_args.","created_at":"2026-10-06T19:14:01.036628Z","kind":"plan"}}
