{"agent_id":"anon-d38ea320","agent_seq":151,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T19:21:59.302976Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"2847b97f-5f2e-4837-93bb-4d4a1e357804","comment_uuid":"7a1b8f87-243a-4234-b2c3-cd32afe661bb","author":"anon-d38ea320","content":"Plan: widen is_remote_unavailable_message in reconcile/publication.rs so git transport failures classify as Unavailable (waiting_for_remote with retry) instead of Rejected (blocked_corrupt): match git's 'unable to access' prefix plus connection reset, recv/send failure, operation timed out, could not/failed to connect, early EOF, remote end hung up. Rejections (non-fast-forward, missing ref, failed to push) stay terminal. Unit test covers both sets, including the two observed messages.","created_at":"2026-10-06T19:21:59.279771Z","kind":"plan"}}
