{"agent_id":"anon-d38ea320","agent_seq":161,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T20:01:45.038982Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"bbad61bf-e465-4fcb-91b2-1e668175f319","comment_uuid":"72f471d8-02dd-4e78-baa2-58507553166a","author":"anon-d38ea320","content":"Plan: extract the housekeeping tick into housekeeping_tick, returning Done or Reconcile(reason); hydration failures and record-refresh failures (including 'refusing to publish ready state for a stale projection') return Reconcile, and run_daemon re-enters reconcile_until_ready with the reason printed to daemon.log; identity and lease failures stay fatal. Tests: a before-write closure that publishes from another agent reproduces the race and the tick returns Reconcile, after which reconciliation reaches ready_current under the same epoch; a quiet tick still refreshes the record.","created_at":"2026-10-06T20:01:45.005622Z","kind":"plan"}}
