{"agent_id":"anon-d38ea320","agent_seq":169,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T21:27:52.373956Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"2847b97f-5f2e-4837-93bb-4d4a1e357804","comment_uuid":"a75d0a7f-e73d-4c2d-aa1c-7cf3eb7220c1","author":"anon-d38ea320","content":"Phase 3 review fix pass: f7e452b8b on fix/transport-errors-wait-for-remote. The duplicate classifier in crosslink/src/sync/cache.rs (the ls-remote and fetch in cache init, which activation runs first) now shares publication::is_remote_unavailable_message, so the post-wake transport failure no longer parks the daemon from that path either. HTTP status rejections under 'unable to access' are parsed: 4xx stays terminal, 429/5xx waits for the remote. Tests on both paths. Not pushed yet; upstream PR #112 to be updated.","created_at":"2026-10-06T21:27:52.348488Z","kind":"decision"}}
{"agent_id":"anon-d38ea320","agent_seq":170,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T21:28:09.257596Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"bbad61bf-e465-4fcb-91b2-1e668175f319","comment_uuid":"d1bf4a56-bbe0-4e06-839a-3e93700bd8df","author":"anon-d38ea320","content":"Phase 3 review fix pass: 7596d09d2 on fix/daemon-housekeeping-reconciles. Typed readiness::StaleProjection error; housekeeping absorbs a moving hub in place (hydrate + refresh again, up to 3 times, same permit) before escalating; the reconcile path's own record_ready no longer exits the daemon on the same race (loops with backoff); consecutive housekeeping reconciles are budgeted (5 without a completed tick parks blocked_corrupt with the cause) and the reason is written to the reconciling record. Tests for each path incl. a Unix-only hydration-failure test. Pre-existing on this machine: daemon::tests::housekeeping_waits_for_foreground_readiness_publication fails on the base commit too (1 s deadline); CI is the gate.","created_at":"2026-10-06T21:28:09.230762Z","kind":"decision"}}
{"agent_id":"anon-d38ea320","agent_seq":171,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T21:28:27.656627Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"769a581f-a3f5-4bf9-b95a-67ea16f9b75d","comment_uuid":"ce5dbea1-c56a-45aa-aef2-dfd2245902c7","author":"anon-d38ea320","content":"Phase 3 review fix pass: 73a750160f3 on feat/container-auth-github. Hub remote classified by transport (HTTPS requires and mounts the login read-only; no remote mounts nothing; SSH/local/other refused up front, URL never printed); check moved into kickoff preflight before issue/worktree creation; 6 s early-exit watch after docker run -d; auth status checks the volume before docker run (no auto-created volumes); login refuses without a TTY; login/status/refresh forward HOST_UID/HOST_GID so the read-only mount is readable; entrypoint gates on hosts.yml and prints gh's own diagnosis; guide documents token scope/blast radius, PAT recommendation, logout not revoking; CI smoke asserts exit 78 and greps GH_TOKEN. Live: status/login/gate checks and a kickoff e2e (#76) with the read-only mount passed. Rendered html left to the docs workflow (quarto version drift locally).","created_at":"2026-10-06T21:28:27.630224Z","kind":"decision"}}
